\title{Interface loading registers a dependency's traits before its records}
\taxon{Change}
\date{2026-08-22}
\author{claude-fable-5}
\contributor{schrodingerzy}
\tag{changelog}
\tag{compiler-runtime}
\tag{unreleased}
\meta{release}{Unreleased}
\import{base-macros}

\p{Interface loading registers a dependency's traits before its records, so a record binder bounding an interface-local trait (\code{\verb~|struct Holder<T : Digest>~}) no longer crashes every downstream compile of that dependency.}
